{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061200/block/singleImage/3253544/df/01M65SDRPGBWBV963SZ26SW2ZB.png?updatedAt=1793343310\"/><figcaption>元朗警區特別職務隊聯同入境處人員打擊非法賣淫，共拘捕23名內地女子(警方圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>元朗警區特別職務隊周四（29日）聯同入境處人員，於區內展開代號「火石」的打擊非法賣淫活動行動。行動中，人員共拘捕23名內地女子，年齡介乎19至49歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查。 元朗警區稱會繼續加大力度，打擊區內賣淫等非法活動。警方呼籲市民，若發現區內有懷疑非法活動，請與警方聯絡。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:04:33.941118+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:55:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:19:12.555705+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:14.973654+00:00","content_hash":"71c67bcd309f3151ffa7f955a90ebdd103d3fbe1648e79ca3f76ae837c9840b4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}